flowchart TD
    Start([Start])
    OpenPage[User opens Transfer page]
    InputRecipient[User enters recipient phone number]
    InputAmount[User enters transfer amount]
    InputPIN[User enters transaction PIN]
    Submit[User submits transfer request]

    ValidateInput{Are all input fields valid?}
    ErrorInput[Display input validation error]

    FindRecipient[System searches recipient by phone number]
    RecipientExists{Does recipient exist?}
    ErrorRecipient[Display recipient not found]

    GetWallets[System retrieves sender and recipient wallets]
    CheckSenderStatus{Is sender wallet ACTIVE?}
    CheckRecipientStatus{Is recipient wallet ACTIVE?}

    ErrorSenderStatus[Display sender wallet status error]
    ErrorRecipientStatus[Display recipient wallet status error]

    VerifyPIN[System verifies transaction PIN]
    PINValid{Is transaction PIN correct?}
    ErrorPIN[Display invalid transaction PIN]

    CheckAmount{Is amount greater than zero?}
    ErrorAmount[Display invalid transfer amount]

    CheckBalance{Is sender balance sufficient?}
    ErrorBalance[Display insufficient balance]

    BeginTransaction[Begin database transaction]
    LockWallets[Lock sender and recipient wallets]
    RecheckBalance[System rechecks sender balance]
    BalanceValid{Is balance still sufficient?}

    GenerateReference[Generate unique transfer reference]
    DebitSender[Deduct amount from sender wallet]
    CreditRecipient[Add amount to recipient wallet]
    CreateDebit[Create sender DEBIT transaction]
    CreateCredit[Create recipient CREDIT transaction]
    SaveData[(Save both wallets and transaction records)]
    Commit[Commit database transaction]

    Success[Display transfer success and updated balance]
    Rollback[Rollback database transaction]
    ErrorSystem[Display transfer failure message]

    End([End])

    Start --> OpenPage
    OpenPage --> InputRecipient
    InputRecipient --> InputAmount
    InputAmount --> InputPIN
    InputPIN --> Submit
    Submit --> ValidateInput

    ValidateInput -- No --> ErrorInput
    ErrorInput --> InputRecipient

    ValidateInput -- Yes --> FindRecipient
    FindRecipient --> RecipientExists

    RecipientExists -- No --> ErrorRecipient
    ErrorRecipient --> InputRecipient

    RecipientExists -- Yes --> GetWallets
    GetWallets --> CheckSenderStatus

    CheckSenderStatus -- No --> ErrorSenderStatus
    ErrorSenderStatus --> End

    CheckSenderStatus -- Yes --> CheckRecipientStatus
    CheckRecipientStatus -- No --> ErrorRecipientStatus
    ErrorRecipientStatus --> End

    CheckRecipientStatus -- Yes --> VerifyPIN
    VerifyPIN --> PINValid

    PINValid -- No --> ErrorPIN
    ErrorPIN --> InputPIN

    PINValid -- Yes --> CheckAmount
    CheckAmount -- No --> ErrorAmount
    ErrorAmount --> InputAmount

    CheckAmount -- Yes --> CheckBalance
    CheckBalance -- No --> ErrorBalance
    ErrorBalance --> End

    CheckBalance -- Yes --> BeginTransaction
    BeginTransaction --> LockWallets
    LockWallets --> RecheckBalance
    RecheckBalance --> BalanceValid

    BalanceValid -- No --> Rollback
    BalanceValid -- Yes --> GenerateReference

    GenerateReference --> DebitSender
    DebitSender --> CreditRecipient
    CreditRecipient --> CreateDebit
    CreateDebit --> CreateCredit
    CreateCredit --> SaveData
    SaveData --> Commit

    Commit --> Success
    Success --> End

    LockWallets -. Database error .-> Rollback
    DebitSender -. Database error .-> Rollback
    CreditRecipient -. Database error .-> Rollback
    CreateDebit -. Database error .-> Rollback
    CreateCredit -. Database error .-> Rollback
    SaveData -. Database error .-> Rollback

    Rollback --> ErrorSystem
    ErrorSystem --> End